# ML Kit discovers its ComponentRegistrar implementations via manifest meta-data and instantiates them reflectively.
# The ML Kit artifacts pin firebase-components 16.1.0, whose shipped rule keeps only the class; R8 full mode does not
# extend that to the default constructor, so MlKitInitProvider fails with NoSuchMethodException on minified builds.
# Same rule firebase-components ships since 18.0.1.
-keep class * implements com.google.firebase.components.ComponentRegistrar { <init>(); }
